    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeremia kulalamika kwa BWANA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wasi ghwa BWANA kwa wundu ghwa wandu wake",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilaghiro ja BWANA kwa Israeli wambao",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghora huwu aighu ya wambao Israeli wose wawiwi, awo wiwadie ifwa ja isanga orejinekieghe wandu wake Israeli jiwuye ifwa jawo: “Ola nichawifunya isangenyi kwawo, na kumvuvua Juda ufume aghadi kwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani ngameria kuwifunya, awo wawiwi, wughoma nichawifuya sena, na kummbunja kula umu wawo andenyi ya ifwa jake na isanga jake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ichakaia, ingelo wichaakufunya kukufundisha chia ra wandu wapo, na kughema kwa irina japo ‘Sa iji Bwana uko moyo,’ wokoni seji werefundishireghe wandu wapo kughema kwa Baali, niko aho wichaamangishwa nicha aghadi ya wandu wapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ikakaia mbari ya wandu ingi ichalegha kusikira, niko nichaifunya putu na kuitotesha,” waghamba BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
